    "## Reviewing and Cleaning the Data\n",
    "\n",
    "I reviewed the dataset to check the column names, data types, and missing values. The horsepower column contains question marks where values are missing, so I replaced them with a pandas missing value and converted the column to numeric.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "b65bef2f-f59a-4950-b644-35f9c0ca76eb",
   "metadata": {},
