      "---  ------        --------------  -----  \n",
      " 0   mpg           398 non-null    float64\n",
      " 1   cylinders     398 non-null    int64  \n",
      " 2   displacement  398 non-null    float64\n",
      " 3   horsepower    398 non-null    object \n",
